   * Integrate official stable KDE Plasma 6.7.5 on Ubuntu 26.04 LTS.
   * Preserve the Ubuntu epoch, public SDK, SONAME 6, symbol guards and QCH.
   * Use exact reviewed ECM and Plasma Wayland Protocols build inputs.
   * Compile upstream manual clients and verify installed Wayland behavior
     through an unchanged Ubuntu SDK client and a rebuilt consumer.
